sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant React as ChatPage.jsx
    participant API as main.py
    participant RAG as rag_service.py
    participant SQLite as SQLite DB
    participant Blob as Azure Blob
    participant Embed as Azure Embeddings
    participant Chroma as ChromaDB
    participant GPT as Azure GPT-4o

    User->>React: "What deductions can I claim under 80D?"
    React->>API: POST /chat {message, user_id, thread_id, user_data}
    API->>SQLite: save_message(user_msg)
    API->>SQLite: get_thread_messages() → history
    API->>RAG: get_financial_advice(query, history, user_data)

    Note over RAG, Chroma: NEW TRUE RAG FLOW
    RAG->>Embed: Convert query → vector embedding
    Embed-->>RAG: query vector [0.012, -0.45, ...]
    RAG->>Chroma: similarity_search(query_vector, k=4)
    Chroma-->>RAG: Top 4 most relevant document chunks
    
    RAG->>GPT: Prompt + RETRIEVED Context + History + User Data
    GPT-->>RAG: Precise, document-backed AI response
    RAG-->>API: response text
    API->>SQLite: save_message(ai_response)
    API->>Blob: backup thread as JSON
    API-->>React: {response: "..."}
    React-->>User: Displays message to User
